&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exit Routes:&lt;/strong&gt; Please use the nearest emergency exits marked on the building map. Follow the emergency lights and exit signs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assembly Point:&lt;/strong&gt; Proceed to the designated assembly point at Assembly Point Location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For your safety, please do not use elevators during the evacuation. Use the stairways and keep calm as you make your way to the nearest exit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you encounter any obstacles or need assistance, please contact our emergency response team&lt;/p&gt;
